.TH ANIME 1 "September 2026" "anime-ctl 0.1.2" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
anime \- manage and watch a local anime collection
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B anime
.RI [ ANIME_NAME
.RI [ EPISODE ]]
.br
.B anime
.BR \-\-rename
.RI [ DIRECTORY ]
.br
.B anime
.BR \-\-add
.I DIRECTORY
.br
.B anime
.BR \-\-move
.I SERIES
.RI [ DESTINATION ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B anime
is a curses-based manager and VLC player for local anime collections.
It browses series and episodes, records watched status in filenames, renames
episode files, and retrieves anime details and artwork through a hosted API.
.PP
On first use, the program asks for the collection directory. Each immediate
subdirectory is treated as a series. Series-name matching is case-insensitive.
Episodes are specified as
.BR ep NUMBER ,
for example
.B ep1
or
.BR ep10 .
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show command-line help and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-rename " [" DIRECTORY "]"
Sort and rename regular files in
.I DIRECTORY
sequentially as
.BR ep1- ,
.BR ep2- ,
and so on. The
.B anime.json
file is excluded. Without a directory, open an interactive selector.
.IP
.B Warning:
this changes filenames in place, removes the original names and extensions,
and provides no undo operation.
.TP
.BI \-\-add " DIRECTORY"
Move a series directory into the configured collection. It is not copied, and
an existing series with the same name is not overwritten.
.TP
.BI \-\-move " SERIES " [ DESTINATION ]
Move a series out of the collection. If
.I DESTINATION
is omitted, use the home directory. The destination must already exist.
.PP
The three action options are mutually exclusive.
.SH INTERACTIVE INTERFACE
Use the Up and Down arrow keys to change the selection and Enter to open it.
The mouse wheel changes the selection; the left button activates supported
actions. Press
.B :
to enter a command. The terminal must be at least 90 columns wide.
.PP
Artwork is displayed when the
.B kitty
executable and graphics protocol are available. The remaining interface works
without artwork.
.SH INTERACTIVE COMMANDS
Quote names and paths containing spaces. Availability depends on the menu.
.TP
.BR "open " ENTRY ", o " ENTRY
Open an entry by its one-based menu number or exact name. From an episode
menu, the name may identify another series.
.TP
.BR "play " SERIES " [" EPISODE "]", "p " SERIES " [" EPISODE "]"
From the series menu, play a named series, optionally beginning at a specified
episode.
.TP
.BR "play [" EPISODE "]", "p [" EPISODE "]"
From an episode menu, play the specified episode. Without an argument, begin
with the first unwatched episode.
.TP
.BR "rename " SERIES ", r " SERIES
From the series menu, rename the named series' files.
.TP
.BR "rename [" SERIES "]", "r [" SERIES "]"
From an episode menu, rename the current or named series.
.TP
.BR "add " DIRECTORY ", a " DIRECTORY
From the series menu, move a directory into the collection.
.TP
.BR "move " SERIES " [" DESTINATION "]"
From the series menu, move a series out of the collection.
.TP
.BR "quit, q"
Exit from the series menu or return to it from an episode menu.
.SH PLAYBACK AND WATCHED STATUS
VLC is run fullscreen with
.BR \-\-play-and-exit .
Playback starts at the selected episode and continues through later episode
entries. After launch, an episode filename receives the suffix
.B watched
unless already marked. The menu can reset watched status.
.SH DIRECTORY STRUCTURE
Episode filenames are expected to begin with
.BR ep NUMBER - .
For example:
.PP
.nf
~/anime/
    Nisekoi/
        ep1-
        ep2-
        ep3-watched
        anime.json
        Extras/
.fi
.PP
The optional
.B Extras
subdirectory accepts entries beginning with
.BR ep ,
.BR op ,
or
.BR ed .
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/anime/directory.json
Collection configuration on Linux. Other systems use the platform-specific
directory selected by
.BR platformdirs (3).
.TP
.I ~/.cache/anime/pictures/
Downloaded artwork on Linux.
.TP
.I SERIES/anime.json
Optional MyAnimeList identifier and retrieved series metadata.
.SH NETWORK
Search, metadata, and artwork require network access. The client uses
.BR https://anime-cli.onrender.com .
MyAnimeList credentials remain on that server.
.SH DEPENDENCIES
VLC must be available as
.B vlc
or
.B vlc.exe
on
.BR PATH .
Tk is used for graphical directory selection. Kitty is optional.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
anime
anime "Nisekoi"
anime "Nisekoi" ep3
anime --add ~/Downloads/Nisekoi
anime --move "Nisekoi" ~/Videos
anime --rename
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
Normal completion returns 0. Argument errors return 2. Runtime failures may
return another nonzero status.
.SH BUGS
Report bugs at https://github.com/jeff841/anime-cli/issues.
